---
layout: layouts/doc.njk
title: API Reference
description: Complete endpoint reference for the WRL API
---
<h1>API Reference</h1>

<p>
  This page documents all {{ api.info.title }} endpoints (v{{ api.info.version }}).
  See the <a href="/authentication/">Authentication guide</a> for how to obtain and use API keys.
</p>

<h2>Base URLs</h2>
<ul>
  {% for server in api.servers %}
  <li>
    <strong>{{ server.description }}:</strong> <code>{{ server.url }}</code>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<div class="alert alert--info" role="note">
  <p>
    <strong>Authentication:</strong> Most endpoints require a Bearer token in the
    <code>Authorization</code> header. Tenant endpoints use per-tenant API keys;
    admin endpoints use the infrastructure <code>ADMIN_KEY</code>.
    See the <a href="/authentication/">Authentication guide</a> for details.
  </p>
</div>

{% for tagGroup in api.tags %}
<h2 id="tag-{{ tagGroup.name }}">{{ tagGroup.name | capitalize }}</h2>
{% if tagGroup.description %}
<p>{{ tagGroup.description }}</p>
{% endif %}

{% for op in tagGroup.operations %}
{% include "partials/endpoint.njk" %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
